ght=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">9cbdc729-696e-4cda-a155-51f02a94d012</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9cbdc729-696e-4cda-a155-51f02a94d012\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9cbdc729-696e-4cda-a155-51f02a94d012\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kith%27rak_Voss\" title=\"Kith'rak Voss\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png/25px-Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png/38px-Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png/50px-Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kith'rak Voss\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png/25px-Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kith%27rak_Voss\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kith'rak Voss\">Kith'rak Voss</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>How pleasantly surprised I was to hear from you, dearest Voss. Why, it seems just yesterday I watched you slice through the Astral Sea in the name of your beloved queen Vlaakith.\n</p><p><br>\nMy goodness, times have changed haven't they?\n</p><p><br>\nAs for your not-inconsiderable request, I might be of some assistance. Yes, I possess the key to breaking the astral prisoner free. But I will require a most valuable promise in return - one you are in no position to make.\n</p><p><br>\nBut if a man of your most illustrious stature requests my audience, who am I to refuse it? Find me in Baldur's Gate, on the upper floors of Sharess' Caress. I can't wait to hear what you've been up to.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202201\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1853/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32392/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9484/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936275/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   53.380      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   53.380      1 -total\n 59.01%   31.501      8 Template:Icon_text\n 53.24%   28.420     19 Template:Trim\n 26.41%   14.096      2 Template:Uid\n 15.39%    8.217      2 Template:Template_style\n 14.80%    7.901      3 Template:Icon_link\n 12.10%    6.458      1 Template:Main_only\n 10.71%    5.715      2 Template:CharLink\n  9.34%    4.985      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:10478-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202201 and revision id 386982. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}